title: Executive
new-page: true
is-pinned-card: true
card-image: img/weimar.jpg
view-if: spd_in_government and chancellor_party == "SPD"

= Executive

Call?

- @snap_election
- @root: Back

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if snap_election_timer > 0 : [+ snap_election_timer +] turns before next advisor action. ?] [? if presidential_powers : We have removed this power from the president with a constitutional reform. ?]
choose-if: snap_election_timer <= 0 and not presidential_powers
on-arrival: snap_election_timer = 96; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; 

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].